  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Features:\r\n\r\n- Beachfront location\r\n- Riparian Rights\r\n- Main dwelling with 4 bedrooms & 2 1/2 bathrooms\r\n- 1 bedroom Guesthouse\r\n- Double westlake & Rangitoto zone\r\n- Sought-after location\r\n\r\nWelcome to 14 The Esplanade, where opportunity meets an unbeatable location. This rare and unique property offers riparian rights with full access to the beach, providing a seamless connection to the water’s edge. Imagine stepping out of your backyard directly onto the sands, enjoying the ultimate lifestyle of sun, sea and serenity.\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of the most sought-after locations, near Milford, Takapuna and the Surrounding East Coast Bays, this property boasts breathtaking views that stretch across the coastline. Whether you enjoy a morning coffee, entertaining friends, or simply unwinding at the end of the day, the coastal panorama is yours to savour.\r\n\r\nThe property is zoned for Rangitoto College and Double Westlake, offering educational options for your family.\r\n\r\nWith the opportunity to rebuild or redesign, you can create the home of your dreams in this unbeatable position. Whether it’s a modern masterpiece or a timeless coastal retreat, the canvas is yours to bring to life.\r\n\r\nFor over 60 years, the current family has cherished this home – a true testament to the lifestyle, community and unbeatable location that this property offers. Now it’s your chance to secure a forever family home that will be loved for generations to come.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss this rare opportunity to own a slice of paradise at 14 The Esplanade.\r\n\r\nCall Lisa or Andy today to arrange your exclusive viewing and begin imagining the next chapter in this incredible location.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
